1
00:07:34,285 --> 00:07:40,285
Teddy Pendergrass: If You Don't Know Me is a documentary,
music film directed by Olivia Lichtenstein.

2
00:15:08,571 --> 00:15:14,571
The untold and ultimately inspiring story of legendary singer, Teddy Pendergrass, the man poised to be the biggest
R&B artist of all time until the tragic accident that changed his life forever at the age of only 31.

3
00:22:42,857 --> 00:22:48,857
Himself, played by Teddy Pendergrass.

4
00:30:17,142 --> 00:30:23,142
"If You Don't Know Me by Now" is a song written by Kenny Gamble and Leon Huff, and
recorded by the Philadelphia soul musical group Harold Melvin & the Blue Notes.

5
00:37:51,428 --> 00:37:57,428
It became their first hit after being released as a single in September 1972, topping
the US R&B chart and peaking at number 3 on the US Billboard Hot 100.

6
00:45:25,714 --> 00:45:31,714
"If You Don't Know Me by Now" was originally written for Labelle (a
trio led by Patti LaBelle) but they never recorded it.

7
00:53:00,000 --> 00:53:06,000
The song's composers Gamble and Huff gave it to Harold Melvin & the Blue Notes, which featured Teddy Pendergrass as lead
vocalist,
and the actual background vocals done by producers Gamble, Huff, Carl Helm, and Bunny Sigler.

8
01:00:34,285 --> 01:00:40,285
In addition to the single release, the track was
included on their debut album, I Miss You.

9
01:08:08,571 --> 01:08:14,571
Patti LaBelle later made the song part of her concert repertoire in
1982; a live version appears on her 1985 album, Patti.

10
01:15:42,857 --> 01:15:48,857
"If You Don't Know Me by Now" has since been recorded by a number of other artists, most notably the English pop
and soul band Simply Red, who took their version to number one on the Billboard Hot 100 in 1989.

11
01:23:17,142 --> 01:23:23,142
The song was chosen as one of the "Songs of the Century" by the
Recording Industry Association of America (RIAA).

12
01:30:51,428 --> 01:30:57,428
The film explores themes of tragic event, inspiring
story, r&b artist, untold story.

13
01:38:25,714 --> 01:38:31,714
The tone is uplifting.
